<title>USA: Snyder Communications Inc to trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Snyder Communications Inc to trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The common shares of Snyder Communications Inc are scheduled to begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange on September 25 under the trading symbol &quot;SNC&quot;.</p>
</text>
